<p>Leap onto an adjacent target with your shield, striking them for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">217%, 244%, 266%, 284%, 300%</acronym> damage and dazing them for 2 turns, then using them as a springboard to leap to a tile within range <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3, 3, 4, 4, 5.</acronym></p><p>The shield bash will use Dexterity instead of Strength for the shield's bonus damage.</p><p>At talent level 5, you will immediately enter a blocking stance on landing.</p>